WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:17.325
Eddy raced after Poppy.

2
00:00:17.326 --> 00:00:21.231
"Poppy, wait!" he cried.

3
00:00:21.232 --> 00:00:23.848
Eddy shot in front of her.

4
00:00:23.849 --> 00:00:27.672
"Let's practice now!" he said.

5
00:00:27.673 --> 00:00:30.792
"No!" said Poppy.

6
00:00:30.793 --> 00:00:34.128
Poppy backed up fast.

7
00:00:34.129 --> 00:00:38.937
She tried to go around Eddy.

8
00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:42.588
Eddy blocked her way.

9
00:00:42.589 --> 00:00:46.952
Poppy backed up again.

10
00:00:46.953 --> 00:00:49.877
Poppy turned.

11
00:00:49.878 --> 00:00:54.121
Then she gasped.

12
00:00:54.122 --> 00:01:00.427
She was next to the curb.

13
00:01:00.428 --> 00:01:07.507
"I did it!" cried Poppy.

14
00:01:07.508 --> 00:01:10.480
"Thanks, Eddy!"

15
00:01:10.481 --> 00:01:14.690
"You're welcome," said Eddy.

16
00:01:14.691 --> 00:01:18.529
"I'm sorry I didn't help before.

17
00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:23.068
Zippy made me so mad."

18
00:01:23.069 --> 00:01:31.679
"It's okay," said Poppy.

19
00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:35.716
"Test time!" called Ms. Fender.

20
00:01:35.717 --> 00:01:48.902
Everyone took the parking test.

21
00:01:48.903 --> 00:01:53.228
"Yay!" Poppy shouted.

22
00:01:53.229 --> 00:02:00.459
"I passed the test!"

23
00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:03.632
Zippy's wheel hit the curb.

24
00:02:03.633 --> 00:02:06.793
"Ugh," he said.

25
00:02:06.794 --> 00:02:09.820
"I failed!"

26
00:02:09.821 --> 00:02:13.270
Ms. Fender smiled.

27
00:02:13.271 --> 00:02:19.443
"Keep practicing, Zippy!"
